  "slug": "age-story",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/20370_age-story.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "The store attendant thought my mother looked very young, and my father was also very happy. They started guessing how old their aunt was. The aunt said, \"Guess how old I am?\" Mom thought for a while and said, \"I think you are about forty years old.\" The aunt smiled and said, \"No, I am fifty years old this year.\" Everyone was surprised. Then, they talked about their zodiac sign, and the question of the year they were born also became interesting."
  ],
  "english_full": "The store attendant thought my mother looked very young, and my father was also very happy. They started guessing how old their aunt was. The aunt said, \"Guess how old I am?\" Mom thought for a while and said, \"I think you are about forty years old.\" The aunt smiled and said, \"No, I am fifty years old this year.\" Everyone was surprised. Then, they talked about their zodiac sign, and the question of the year they were born also became interesting.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Служа́щая в скла́де ду́мала, что ма́ма выгляд́ит са́мой молодо́й, а ба́тя то́же был са́мым счастли́вым. Они́ нача́ли дога́дываться, сколь́ко ле́т их тётя. Тётя ска́зала: «Дога́дайся, сколь́ко мне ле́т?» Ма́ма по́думала неко́торое вре́мя и ска́зала: «Дума́ю, тебе о́коло сорока́ лет.» Тётя улы́бнулась и ска́зала: «Нет, мне пятьдеся́т ле́т в э́том году́.» Все были изумлённые. Тогда́ они го́ворили о своём знаке зодиа́ка, и вопро́с о году́, в кото́ром они́ роди́лись, то́же ста́л интере́сным."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Slúzhashchaya v skláde dúmala, chto máma výglidit sámóy molodóy, a bátya tózhe byl sámým schastlívym. Oní nacháli dogádyvatsya, skól'ko lét ikh tétya. Tét'ya skázala: «Dogáidaysya, skól'ko mne lét?» Máma pódumala nekótoroje vrémya i skázala: «Dumáyu, tebe ókolo soroká lét.» Tét'ya ulýbnulas' i skázala: «Net, mne pyát'desyát lét v étom godú.» Vse býli izumlyónnye. Togdá oni gово́rili o svoém znake zodiáka, i vopros o godú, v kotoróm oní rodílis', tózhe stál interéssnym."
  ],
